<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal leaves fixed rates unchanged.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal leaves fixed rates unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal left its official draining and emergency lending rates unchanged at the start of a the new commercial bank reserve period on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Bank offered to drain liquidity at a fixed 6.8 percent, with bids to be presented by 1400 GMT.</p>
<p>Its emergency lending rate for up to 100 billion escudos of one-day funds to resident banks was unchanged at 9.0 percent.</p>
<p>--LISBON BUREAU 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
